  "description": {
    "en": "Solinco Revolution is a firm, six-sided co-polyester string engineered for players with fast swings who want explosive power, high spin and highly predictable control. Its hexagonal profile increases ball grip and rotation, while the high-powered monofilament construction helps players manipulate ball flight with precision. Despite its relatively high stiffness, Revolution is designed to reduce vibration and off-center shock, providing a more controlled and comfortable response than its firm construction might suggest.",

    "zh": "Solinco Revolution 是一款采用六边形截面的偏硬型高性能共聚酯球线，主要面向挥拍速度快、追求爆发力量、高旋转和精准控制的球员。六边形结构能够增强咬球和旋转，而高性能单丝配方则强化对球路和飞行轨迹的控制。虽然整体刚性较高，但 Revolution 特别强调降低震动和偏心击球冲击，使它在保持清晰、稳定反馈的同时，具备比典型硬质聚酯更好的击球舒适度。"
  },

